@startuml

title Network Server - Procesamiento y evaluación del uplink

left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false

skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam classFontSize 18
skinparam classAttributeFontSize 15
skinparam classMethodFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14

skinparam packageTitleFontSize 16
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam Padding 8

skinparam nodesep 20
skinparam ranksep 20


class NetworkServer {
    + receiveFromGateway(...)
    + registerTransmissionMetric(...) : LinkBudgetResult
}


package "Procesamiento de uplink" as PKG_UPLINK {

    class UplinkProcessor {
        + process(payload : String) : UplinkContext
    }

    class UplinkContext {
        + getDeviceId() : String
        + getFields() : Map
        + isConfirmed() : boolean
    }
}


package "Evaluación de transmisión" as PKG_EVAL {

    class LinkBudgetService {
        + evaluate(...) : LinkBudgetResult
    }

    class LinkBudgetResult {
        + getPathLossDb() : double
        + getRxPowerDbm() : double
        + getMarginDb() : double
    }

    class PacketLossSimulator {
        + shouldDrop() : boolean
        + getLossProbability() : double
    }

    class DuplicateFrameDetector {
        + isDuplicate(...) : boolean
    }
}


class DeviceSession <<estado de sesión>>


NetworkServer *-- UplinkProcessor
NetworkServer *-- LinkBudgetService
NetworkServer *-- PacketLossSimulator
NetworkServer *-- DuplicateFrameDetector

UplinkProcessor --> UplinkContext : genera

LinkBudgetService --> LinkBudgetResult : genera

DuplicateFrameDetector --> DeviceSession : consulta


UplinkProcessor -[hidden]right- LinkBudgetService
LinkBudgetService -[hidden]right- PacketLossSimulator
PacketLossSimulator -[hidden]right- DuplicateFrameDetector


note bottom of NetworkServer
Coordina la recepción y evaluación
de cada transmisión uplink.
end note

@enduml